
  SPECTRAL THEORY OF THE TOURNAMENT FLIP MARKOV CHAIN

======================================================================

  I. THE EIGENVALUE DENOMINATORS
  --------------------------------------------------

  Flip chain on tiling space {0,1}^m, m = C(n-1, 2).
  Eigenvalues: lambda_k = (m - 2k)/m for k = 0, ..., m.

  n= 3: m=  1, m=1, factor=1           , denom divisors=[1]
  n= 4: m=  3, m=3, factor=3           , denom divisors=[1, 3]
